bar.com/rock-alternative/sufjan-stevens/sufjan-stevens-blue-bucket-of-gold-b-w-hotline-bling-featuring-gallant-translucent-blue-vinyl-vinyl-record?ucc=US\u0026srsltid=AfmBOooHC2PtSmkGi1x4o1ijUReO6z0ZY6812tRBUObpNIY66eX2_-h_06A\u0026utm_content=YT3-YMsQJSDpz2ROovUzd397pZ0oL3CS7EVLknBsjDshkv7Vb2HKTWsgmrbgRKjssK9f2D0gDxcCh8BrxZJt9CdwJ9Dm\u0026utm_term=UCMi8tQF_L7rd6YcmSt7MXrQ\u0026utm_medium=product_shelf\u0026utm_source=youtube","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.merchbar.com/rock-alternative/sufjan-stevens/sufjan-stevens-blue-bucket-of-gold-b-w-hotline-bling-featuring-gallant-translucent-blue-vinyl-vinyl-record?ucc=US\u0026srsltid=AfmBOooHC2PtSmkGi1x4o1ijUReO6z0ZY6812tRBUObpNIY66eX2_-h_06A\u0026utm_content=YT3-YMsQJSDpz2ROovUzd397pZ0oL3CS7EVLknBsjDshkv7Vb2HKTWsgmrbgRKjssK9f2D0gDxcCh8BrxZJt9CdwJ9Dm\u0026utm_term=UCMi8tQF_L7rd6YcmSt7MXrQ\u0026utm_medium=product_shelf\u0026utm_source=youtube","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}]}},"accessibilityTitle":"Sufjan Stevens BLUE BUCKET OF GOLD B/W HOTLINE BLING (FEATURING GALLANT) (TRANSLUCENT BLUE VINYL) Vinyl Record LP Album, Limited delivery areas , from Merchbar","buttonAccessibilityText":"Buy merchandise from Merchbar","fromVendorText":"From Merchbar","additionalFeesText":"+ additional fees","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"Limited delivery areas"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Sufjan Stevens Greatest Gift (Translucent Yellow) Vinyl Record LP Album","description":"\"Limited colored vinyl LP pressing. The Greatest Gift is a mixtape of outtakes, remixes, and demos from Sufjan's 2015 album Carrie \u0026 Lowell. This collection serves as a companion piece to the Carrie \u0026 Lowell Live album released earlier this year (and as an expansion to the original album). In the same way, the live show featured re-interpretations of the songs from Carrie \u0026 Lowell, the mixtape unveils new remixes by several longstanding collaborators including Roberto C. Lange (aka Helado Negro), Thomas Bartlett (aka Doveman), and James McAlister (aka 900X). The album also features Sufjan's own remix of \"\"Drawn to the Blood.\"\" The mixtape includes a few alternate and/or demo versions of songs from the original album. The digital release also contains an iPhone demo of the song \"\"Carrie \u0026 Lowell.\"\" The mixtape features four previously unreleased new songs, \"\"official\"\" outtakes from Carrie \u0026 Lowell (they were recorded at the same time as the album). These include \"\"Wallowa Lake Monster,\"\" \"\"The Hidden River of My Life,\"\" \"\"City of Roses,\"\" and \"\"The Greatest Gift.\"\" This new material, in its investigation of love, life, death, God, and the beautiful state of Oregon, serves as a contemplative companion to the original album. Sufjan Stevens store / shop.\"","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT7sMfUto_o2azrSlosMtHXDE2NGfkDUKhakMbpfhOHnS7ofOn845HRCD5GXQSBu7A7LSbjN2I","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQnBV-CtStaT3Ig97H4jVp3pBnay2GvOG71KGI4g0GryV5e4kV6JKrfX1cxAulVlmb4mJ_W5FM","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQW0-glvlayKZBWegfiPl25UKGeE8Ck0H9Y-Nl5ngHlt4GE09PZ11N7u-FghFTWxlpeHKTjQcg","width":512,"height":511}]},"price":"£16.43","vendorName":"Merchbar","trackingParams":"CPkCEJP0ARgDIhMI3eetxM--kgMV95N8Bh0y3zJo","buttonText":"Shop","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPkCEJP0ARgDIhMI3eetxM--kgMV95N8Bh0y3zJoygEEESUn7A==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPkCEJP0ARgDIhMI3eetxM--kgMV95N8Bh0y3zJoygEEESUn7A==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLzO3ZUfLt4lL1bBIQ5POD0o_6zqgAZOzEiSpC7MWtX9WccgDYif1Nm0Skq8Il2shApsYwKEJ2I_NtafUjerSd_jCf0hf20JxOUnpV04w-IjQEEe2_71KYFD672jbmOC4J5vues2opnt_FxMW1Z3WowFpwqsgqJXkzKlTT4nx5tgJeAdR